{53}{How did half-orc get to be blacksmith?}{}{-4}{lf3 0}{55}{}
{54}{[back]}{}{1}{}{39}{}
{55}{I get that a lot.  I was abandoned as a child.  I spent several years living on the streets, scavenging and stealing what I needed to survive.  I never stayed in one place long...  Until I came to Blackroot.}{I get that a lot.  I was abandoned as a child.  I spent several years living on the streets, scavenging and stealing what I needed to survive.  I never stayed in one place long...  Until I came to Blackroot.}{}{}{}{}
{57}{What was different in Blackroot?}{}{5}{}{60}{}
{58}{Wha' happen when you get here?}{}{-4}{}{60}{}
{59}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}
{60}{The old blacksmith, Gurney, didn't have any children.  But he wanted someone to keep the shop running after he was gone.  So he took pity on me and made me his apprentice.  He worked me long, hard hours.  Yet he was a fair man.  He passed a few years back.  ...I still miss him.}{The old blacksmith, Gurney, didn't have any children.  But he wanted someone to keep the shop running after he was gone.  So he took pity on me and made me his apprentice.  He worked me long, hard hours.  Yet he was a fair man.  He passed a few years back.  ...I still miss him.}{}{}{}{}
{61}{Yeah, well, people die.  That's too bad.  I have another question...}{}{5}{}{39}{re -5, lf3 1}
{62}{Quite an interesting tale.  Can I ask you something else?}{}{5}{}{39}{lf3 1}
{63}{Oh!  You've had a hard life.  I am sorry for your loss, as well.}{}{5}{}{67}{re +10, lf3 1}
{64}{Uh...  Dat too bad.  Me ask sumthin' more?}{}{-4}{}{39}{re -5, lf3 1}
{65}{Dat sound like hard life.  I sorry he die.  I know that make you sad...}{}{-4}{}{67}{re +10, lf3 1}
{66}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{lf3 1}
{67}{You know...  Most people don't give a damn about me...  Always talkin' about me being a half breed bastard and such.  Some even do it to my face.  It's a rare few who actually care enough to say a kind word.  Thank you.  Here...  Take this.  It's a little something I made.  A gift, for your kindness.}{You know...  Most people don't give a damn about me...  Always talkin' about me being a half breed bastard and such.  Some even do it to my face.  It's a rare few who actually care enough to say a kind word.  Thank you.  Here...  Take this.  It's a little something I made.  A gift, for your kindness.}{}{}{}{in -2824}
{68}{Why...  Thank you!  Can I ask you something else?}{}{5}{}{39}{}
{69}{Oh!  T'ank you!  Me ask you sumthin' more?}{}{-4}{}{39}{}
{70}{That spendthrift!  I bet he told you all about how I'm trying to overcharge him for his precious strongbox, didn't he?  He's got the nicest place in town, and he wants to quibble over a few coin...}{That spendthrift!  I bet he told you all about how I'm trying to overcharge him for his precious strongbox, didn't he?  He's got the nicest place in town, and he wants to quibble over a few coin...}{}{}{}{}
{71}{He did mention the incident.  Can you tell me what happened?}{}{5}{}{75}{}
